Jim McKinney wrote:
> 
> John Hill wrote:
> >
> > Todd Wallace wrote:
> > >
> > > Does anyone know if the DEC DE435 EtherWORKS Turbo PCI adapter (whew!)
> > > in my 2100 box is capable of 100 mbps capable?
