	Yes.  Please see my "Alpha Muddling 1" for Mr. K.  Another quote
	is coming up shortly... But regarding Terry Shannon's point 
	about advertising and why we shouldn't be surprised.  I agree
	that may have some bearing, but how do we put any confidence
	in what we read if what we are reading is fictional?  Getting
	to specifics shortly.  I don't agree with Terry in that: yes
	it is an opinion piece but when the facts are ignored or skirted
	to make product/issue "A" look better compared to "B" that 
	IS annoying.  Actually, it is superior marketing.  Maybe they
