tests on all platforms before it goes to QA. I don't want him waiting
until the very end before even BUILDING on all target platforms!

To be specific: You finish a class or testable portion of a class:
test it all around. You finish fixing a bug: test it on all platforms.
Don't wait until there are several days of work to test and you're
ready to send it to QA before you find that you caused a problem days
ago but you're no longer sure which of your changes caused it because
