>OpenVMS 6.1. The login prompt and some other messages are wrote direct
>on the console, which mess-up the login window.
>
>Anyway to stop the console messages.


Try to disable the OPA0 by either doing a
$SET TERMINAL/PERMANENT/NOBROADCAST OPA0:
in the SYLOGICALS.COM which is executed at startup.

Or You can do a
$DEFINE/SYSTEM OPC$OPA0_ENABLE "FALSE" in the same file.

Good luck






