Geoff Bryant provided the clue to solving this problem.  My original and
his reply are quoted below.

As I neglected to note, the Alpha is running Digital Unix 4.0B.  The
equivalent to his suggestion was to use dxkerneltuner to change a
parameter in inet.  The parameter is pmtu_enabled, which I changed from
one (enabled) to zero (disabled).

Voila - it works.

