Newsgroups: comp.sys.dec


Hello !

>I'm looking for a tool which will position a tape at the end of the last
>file.

You should use 

mt seod ; mt bsf

The tape has the structure
	... record ..record eof record .. record eof eof
The double eof is the end of tape, and the last eof is DATA.
so mt seod will put you behind the last eof. with mt bsf you
go behind the last file. Then you can append files to the tape.

Bye
Matthias




