I use a H8571-J.  This is an adapter from DB-9 to the Dec RJ connector(if
memory serves me right, it is called an RS-423 connector).  It ran me about
$20 from DEC Direct about 3 years ago.  Since then they have come with
every Alpha Server we have bought.  But they do tend to disappear it they 
are not put away.  I currently use one to connect a raid array 310 to 
a VT420 using the DEC Cable.

This connector is used by one of the people here to print from a PC to 
a LA75 printer.

