  The VAXstation 3100 model 40 and 48 enclosure is slightly over 14 cm
  tall, has mounting space for five disks, and three rows of side vents.

  The VAXstation 3100 model 30 and 38 enclosure is rather shorter than
  14 cm, has mounting space for three disks, and two rows of side vents.

  The CPU modules for the VAXstation 3100 models 30 and 40 are the same,
  as are the CPU modules for the VAXstation 3100 models 38 and 48 -- the
  difference is the enclosure used -- the 40 and 48 series use the larger
  system enclosure...

