I'm still wondering how Micro$oft managed to brainwash so many managers
to believe in NT. "NT is the future. Micro$oft says so, and as it's
inventor, they must know it." Just like IBM in the 70's.

As for the price of PCs, that's been a long debate. I use Sun's
