>I need to know what model this is. I think its a model 40 but im not
>sure. Is there a place on the back or something that says what the model
>number is?

There's a model number sticker on the back of the unit (it's yellow).  A 
VS3100/40 would have a model number of VS42S-JH.

As for the console, here's what I did...

Take an RJ-11 connector (I used a phone extension cable and wacked the clip 
off the connector and chopped the other end off).  Wire as follows:

        VS3100 (pin 1 on left side)             DB25 female
           1 (TX+) (black)             ->       3
           2 (TX-) (Red)              ----|
                                          | --> 7
           3 (RX-) (Green)            ----| 
           4 (RX+) (Yellow)            ->       2

