Options Catalog. Purchasers of OpenVMS-based au-Series PWs will receive
the "Value License Package" when they order an OVMS system part number. 

Here's what you get:

1 QL-MT1AE-6X  OpenVMS Alpha BASE License
1 QL-MT3AA-3B  OVMS 1-User Concurrent License
1 QL-36NAE-AA NAS CL 150 V/A Traditional License
1 QL-0ADAE-AA Open3D V/A Traditional License
1 QL-4G9A9-AA MMS RT U/A Traditional License

Based on the recent posting from our Neighbor to the North, one can
expect the US MLP of a 500au running VMS to be around nine grand. That's
$1K more than DUNIX, and twice the price of a WNT system.

