isn't.  EIDE, under perfect conditions, can barely keep up.  Remember,
you want to spend at most an hour burning the CD-ROM, not 2 days.

The burn can be aborted if the CPU diverts the slightest amount of
attention to another task, and after three or four aborted burns,
