> BV>
> BV> -Just removed from working machine
> BV> -Guaranteed NOT DOA

>Well, that's a _little_ high for such an old, small drive; but at least 
>your asking price is not totally ridiculous, like some who post here all 
>to often.  Given that, I'm inclined to not "sweat the small stuff," as 
>it were.  ;-)

If he felt the price was high, he wouldn't have bought.  He knows full
well that he is saving at least $5 or $10 here.

>So, OK -- I'll go the $35.  Terms: FOB my doorstep, via your choice of 
>shipping method; payment to be either COD/check or via return U.S. Mail 
>upon receipt of goods.

>Assuming that's acceptable, let me know ASAP, and I'll forward my 
