awesome deals on vastly underpriced items whereever I found them.  I
haven't checked your web page, but if your prices were as low as you
suggest, I'd be more than happy to accept your offer to be made a
chump of, and buy your entire inventory, happily reselling it all at a
profit, while still saving others a respctable amount of money with
the price I would set.  I take it this is what you are attempting to
accomplish with me.  Don't attach your business name next time.

