> The Big Question is, who will be the next to join the DEC/Sequent
> alliance? Might it be Siemans/Pyramid? Or mayhap DG? Stay tuned!
>

I heartily agree that this is the biggest question (which typically has been
overlooked), and I think that it only serves to benefit the Alpha.  I think
that the goal from the beginning of this DEC/Sequent relationship has been,
in large part, to encourage others to join the lovefest.  Every vendor that
joins simply adds resources to what is DEC's biggest downfall - lack of
applications.  If DEC had the application support that Sun or HP have today,
we wouldn't be having these discussions.  Quite simply, every application
that gets added to DU/Merced is another application easily ported to
DU/Alpha.  I can't wait!

