very close to the 19" model.  My company used both when they were
current products.

The monitors are 1280 x 1024 resolution only, 72 or 66 Hz refresh rate.
The monitors are not auto-syncing except for the refresh rate.  The
monitors are also sync-on-green only.  This will be obvious if you 
have one to look at since there are only the 3 BNC connectors for the 
video connection!

Video bandwith:  100 MHz

                   Low Scan (66 Hz)    High Scan (72 Hz)

Pixel clock        119.8 MHz           130.8 MHz
Scan frequency      70.7 kHz            77.1 kHz
