Hi,

I'm not sure this'll work on a VAX; but you could give it a try.

At the console:

Ctrl-P

At the ">>>" prompt:

>>> D PC 00000000

(this invalidates the PC)

>>> D PS 1F

(this raises IPL to 31)

>>> C

(continues the operation)

The system should crash within a few seconds.

Greetings,

Kris Clippeleyr (aka Qkcl)

