We made a number of different modules for the Jensen. Early on in the
process we got bit by a shortage of Flash memory devices from the original
supplier. We redesigned the module to accomodate a different vendor. At
the time, there was no standard Flash memory pin-out nor interface. Well,
luck would have it, another shortage and another design. The last design
included capability for one vendors Flash memory or anothers, depending
upon part availability. I suspect you have these later model modules. So,
a call to Field Service should be able to help you out as to which vendor
to use in the socket and how to remove the other from the module. It may
in fact be better to take it in to Field Service, they may be the only
people with the requisite material to make your modules work again, as I
doubt that those original Falsh parts are available any longer.
Send me mail if you have no luck with Field Service, I will see what I can
find out. If you do send mail, I'd like the module part number and
revision exactly.

