    		Dann Lunsford <dann@greycat.com> writes:
> Well, both of my rescued-from-the-junkpile Vaxstation 3100-76's are
> functioning nicely.  I've even re-joined DECUS on my own, rather than on
> my boss's buck :-). And today I put in the order for what appears to be
