Have you looked in the BIOS configuration of the 16MB system and made 
sure that COM2 is disabled? That's what usually uses IRQ 3. Or, change 
the IRQ on the card to 5. That's not used by any of the standard devices.

>I would very much appreciate any suggestions as I have been working on this
>problem for some time now 

Trying to use IRQs assigned to standard devices is generally a bad idea. It's
better to use ones that aren't preassigned, like 5, 10, and 11.


