Hi,

phaedrus@mailhost.ultra.net.au wrote:
: Have been offered an Alpha 166 Mhz "multia UDB" with "Ultrix".
:        I have no expereince with Alphas' so can anyone tell me what it
: is and can VMS be installed instead of Ultrix ?

Neither Ultrix nor VMS will run on the UDB. Ultrix was officially only
available for VAXen and the MIPS-based DECstations, VMS doesn't support
the UDB.

Your choices of operating system are:
- OSF/1 aka Digital Unix
- Linux
- NetBSD
- OpenBSD
- Windows NT (if you really want it ...)

regards,
